<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">suggest</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">suggest</ansi> command lets you share ideas and suggestions with the admin team.
All suggestions are saved and reviewed.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage:</ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">suggest <your idea></ansi>

  Examples:
    <ansi fg="command">suggest It would be cool if we could craft arrows at the workbench.</ansi>
    <ansi fg="command">suggest The training dummy in Sanctum Basin should give feedback on form.</ansi>

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help bug</ansi>
